System Architecture Diagram 
Frontend 
• Web Application (React / Angular) 
• Mobile App (optional) 
Backend 
• Application Server developed using Java 
• REST APIs 
The backend logic, business rules, and REST API services will be implemented using Java to 
ensure reliability, scalability, and maintainability. 
Database 
• Centralized Database using MySQL 
• Stores users, waste requests, collection logs, reports 
MySQL will be used to store and manage user records, waste pickup requests, complaints, 
collection schedules, route details, status updates, and generated reports. 
Integration Components 
• Notification System (Email/SMS) 
• GPS/Route Optimization (optional) 
